{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The worlds of SUSHI Race and BURGER Race collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test out 22 different machines, each with its own characteristics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite and enjoy high-speed racing battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to brand-new courses, you'll also find some classic racetracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for top speed as you race through each thrilling, action-packed course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new game mode makes its debut: Team Battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your teammates, use items strategically, and defeat the opposing team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Time Attack\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a course and record your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world in online rankings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Free Race\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a course to run with friends and CPUs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With items and special events, the racing experience is totally different from Time Attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grand Prix\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through several courses of your choice in order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate wins and become the grand champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Team Battle\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a side: Sushi or Burger, and let the heated battle begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winner is determined by each team's total points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and family for 1st place and have fun!</p>","background":"https://st